   "text": "# English Interactive Lessons\n\nA lightweight, touchscreen-friendly homepage for MRISB Grade 7 and Grade 8 English interactive classroom activities.\n\n## Live site\n\nhttps://buildbothworlds.github.io/english-interactive-lessons/\n\n## Structure\n\n- `index.html` — teacher homepage\n- `grade-7/` — Grade 7 weekly activities\n- `grade-8/` — Grade 8 weekly activities\n\nEach weekly activity is a self-contained HTML file with no external runtime dependency.\n",
